{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Ndipo Bildadi Mshuhi akajibu:"},{"verse":2,"text":"“Mamlaka na kuheshimiwa ni vyake Mungu;"},{"verse":3,"text":"Je, majeshi yake yaweza kuhesabika?"},{"verse":4,"text":"Mtu awezaje kuwa mwadilifu mbele za Mungu?"},{"verse":5,"text":"Ikiwa hata mwezi sio mwangavu"},{"verse":6,"text":"sembuse mtu ambaye ni funza:"}]}